                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iXrClRCzuNS2wOoiY"><h3>What does it taste like?</h3></div
                  ><div data-instant-type="icon" class="iEz2fkykmQn7nvw3x">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="instant-icon">
                      <title>caret-down</title><path d="M213.66,101.66l-80,80a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-80-80A8,8,0,0,1,53.66,90.34L128,164.69l74.34-74.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"></path>
                    </svg></div></button
                ><div class="iRU1cXxStm7poqH6k" data-instant-type="accordion-content" style="--instant-accordion-content-height:auto;--instant-accordion-content-width:auto"
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iWxHJPudlDFnVR8ok"><p>If you&apos;re used to vapor, Lio may not be as strong as you&apos;d expect at first. Lio can be compared to a herbal tea if vapor was compared to a sticky soda. Not as sweet, and a lot more natural.</p></div></div
                ></div
              ><div data-state="closed" class="iKzZHGuVVIjYir7nz" data-instant-type="accordion-item"
                ><button class="iniryHF5G0B0kEF9t" data-instant-type="accordion-header" type="button"
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iJCZYrCbWWn1j0XiI"><h3>What is Lio?</h3></div
                  ><div data-instant-type="icon" class="ivoOrvba7cD3A4aFm">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="instant-icon">
                      <title>caret-down</title><path d="M213.66,101.66l-80,80a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-80-80A8,8,0,0,1,53.66,90.34L128,164.69l74.34-74.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"></path>
                    </svg></div></button
                ><div class="ihBoMy9AFCY3PRFI6" data-instant-type="accordion-content" style="--instant-accordion-content-height:auto;--instant-accordion-content-width:auto"
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text i63GUmQKBB2ya7VIR"><p>Lio is a natural habit-breaking device that uses aromatherapy to help you manage cravings without nicotine, chemicals, or harmful additives. It works through olfactory conditioning, the science of how scent influences your brain and behavior.</p></div></div
                ></div
              ><div data-state="closed" class="igPABeDc9EbZOcNqX" data-instant-type="accordion-item"
                ><button class="iGzt4sP7qxuhmn3sU" data-instant-type="accordion-header" type="button"
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text ivl8aAdNussKOOgEg"><h3>How does Lio work?</h3></div
                  ><div data-instant-type="icon" class="ijom98G7n63VMDAoJ">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="instant-icon">
                      <title>caret-down</title><path d="M213.66,101.66l-80,80a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-80-80A8,8,0,0,1,53.66,90.34L128,164.69l74.34-74.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"></path>
                    </svg></div></button
                ><div class="ia9N07Gnme8LPmtuD" data-instant-type="accordion-content" style="--instant-accordion-content-height:auto;--instant-accordion-content-width:auto"
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iL0znOwy36MdfusAE"><p>Stopping a bad habit cold turkey is extremely hard on your brain. Lio helps by replacing your hand-to-mouth fixation, encouraging calming breaths that reduce stress, activating scent receptors that interrupt habit pathways, and providing immediate sensory satisfaction with natural aromatherapy. You&apos;re breathing nothing but clean air infused with natural plant aromatics, no nicotine, no chemicals, no vapor.</p></div></div
                ></div
              ><div data-state="closed" class="i8xWd3YVif6IlXN8s" data-instant-type="accordion-item"
                ><button class="i5hH6BiqNfOLa1guy" data-instant-type="accordion-header" type="button"
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text ipDWnrbmkqOGdch6t"><h3>How can something with no nicotine actually work?</h3></div
                  ><div data-instant-type="icon" class="iHCNQeteLEAdQJMcU">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="instant-icon">
                      <title>caret-down</title><path d="M213.66,101.66l-80,80a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-80-80A8,8,0,0,1,53.66,90.34L128,164.69l74.34-74.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"></path>
                    </svg></div></button
                ><div class="iDZSRYawVSbdElBmv" data-instant-type="accordion-content" style="--instant-accordion-content-height:auto;--instant-accordion-content-width:auto"
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text i8KMd6hOR6rZ8S9jX"><p>Here&apos;s what most people don&apos;t know: addiction isn&apos;t just about the chemical substance. Science shows it&apos;s ritual plus chemical. The hand-to-mouth motion, the deep breathing, the sensory triggers, these behavioral patterns create 50-70% of the addiction. Lio targets this ritual component. Your brain doesn&apos;t just crave the substance, it craves the entire experience. That&apos;s why customers say it "works like magic" even without nicotine.</p></div></div
                ></div
              ><div data-state="closed" class="iOZNmSY0ZopEikngu" data-instant-type="accordion-item"
                ><button class="i2i4c7L8UKbD5MTHD" data-instant-type="accordion-header" type="button"
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text i2aZr46BZy5FwL3nz"><h3>This looks like another wellness gimmick. Is it really different?</h3></div
                  ><div data-instant-type="icon" class="iq73ZsB3llFoyAeEb">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="instant-icon">
                      <title>caret-down</title><path d="M213.66,101.66l-80,80a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-80-80A8,8,0,0,1,53.66,90.34L128,164.69l74.34-74.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"></path>
                    </svg></div></button
                ><div class="ixmpBsUCEknZclMJV" data-instant-type="accordion-content" style="--instant-accordion-content-height:auto;--instant-accordion-content-width:auto"
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iitkyk8NYKSf3R8w4"><p>Lio isn&apos;t based on Instagram trends. It&apos;s grounded in established research on olfactory conditioning and behavioral psychology. We use pharmaceutical-grade aromatics from IFRA-certified EU farms, have multiple 3rd party toxicology reports, and have helped 100,000+ customers across 50+ countries achieve real results. Our devices are produced in the Netherlands with medical-grade materials. This is a clinical tool based on sensory science, not a lifestyle accessory.</p></div></div
                ></div
              ><div data-state="closed" class="imirmkGR8w5ugqloR" data-instant-type="accordion-item"
                ><button class="iPLjhtlcCIz03z22L" data-instant-type="accordion-header" type="button"
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text ipPgTbBb4sSgIoeXr"><h3>Will this actually satisfy my cravings?</h3></div
                  ><div data-instant-type="icon" class="iVgmqsVOHi88UDwiC">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="instant-icon">
                      <title>caret-down</title><path d="M213.66,101.66l-80,80a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-80-80A8,8,0,0,1,53.66,90.34L128,164.69l74.34-74.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"></path>
                    </svg></div></button
                ><div class="iPc4uFxl95QenLLYq" data-instant-type="accordion-content" style="--instant-accordion-content-height:auto;--instant-accordion-content-width:auto"
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text ipWyI2qw46oZusJ36"><p>Yes. Lio mimics the physical sensations you&apos;re craving: the throat hit from menthol blends, the hand-to-mouth ritual, the stress relief from deep breathing, and the immediate sensory reward. You&apos;re not white-knuckling through cravings, you&apos;re satisfying them in a healthier way. As one customer said: "It gives the throat feeling like a cig without the harm."</p></div></div
                ></div
              ><div data-state="closed" class="iCwuGofUQ4QVQvBgl" data-instant-type="accordion-item"
                ><button class="iwH9sYjlc9Ag8y07b" data-instant-type="accordion-header" type="button"
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iFwOTQOBiZtZW0vuW"><h3>Will it work for my specific habit?</h3></div
                  ><div data-instant-type="icon" class="iDFsXW3Gqpt3VVP4u">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="instant-icon">
                      <title>caret-down</title><path d="M213.66,101.66l-80,80a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-80-80A8,8,0,0,1,53.66,90.34L128,164.69l74.34-74.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"></path>
                    </svg></div></button
                ><div class="itEKOrZtRn225xC23" data-instant-type="accordion-content" style="--instant-accordion-content-height:auto;--instant-accordion-content-width:auto"
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iYKPG4FiySxCtiPzC"><p>Lio works for any behavior driven by ritual and sensory triggers: chain smoking, vaping, electric shisha, sugar cravings, nail biting, and any repetitive hand-to-mouth behavior. The common thread isn&apos;t the substance, it&apos;s the pattern. If your habit involves repetitive motion and immediate gratification, Lio&apos;s sensory replacement approach will work.</p></div></div
                ></div
              ></div
            ></div
          ><div class="ieRMta1R7VX2uDzGE" data-instant-type="tabs-pane" id="eRMta1R7VX2uDzGE"
            ><div class="i1HF0Z6foibqR2O5Z" data-instant-type="accordion-container" data-is-first-open="true" data-is-multi-open-enabled="false"
              ><div data-state="open" class="iiIOyDuUPSbRIZAH6" data-instant-type="accordion-item"
                ><button class="ihvGdd4ViMOByppbL" data-instant-type="accordion-header" type="button"
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text ijmZH5F4GYGUQp73U"><h3>Is Lio safe?</h3></div
                  ><div data-instant-type="icon" class="iLU9kY9mchNsMfQQH">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="instant-icon">
                      <title>caret-down</title><path d="M213.66,101.66l-80,80a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-80-80A8,8,0,0,1,53.66,90.34L128,164.69l74.34-74.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"></path>
                    </svg></div></button
                ><div class="i4VrzUpE7yxjtnPJY" data-instant-type="accordion-content" style="--instant-accordion-content-height:auto;--instant-accordion-content-width:auto"
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iT0O870QqrciM0ZJx"><p>Yes. Multiple 3rd party toxicology reports and studies have been done on the inhalation and digestion of the plant compounds we use. We&apos;re committed to funding ongoing research. BreatheLio is the healthiest, most natural habit-breaking method available.</p></div></div
                ></div
              ><div data-state="closed" class="ilBwAZx9LMZe5BkVW" data-instant-type="accordion-item"
                ><button class="iAJ9FmPP21wwilymo" data-instant-type="accordion-header" type="button"
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iWz8xKaxsvVIocH6F"><h3>What are Flavour Cores made of?</h3></div
                  ><div data-instant-type="icon" class="iEZO1zmBpDndqq0oq">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="instant-icon">
                      <title>caret-down</title><path d="M213.66,101.66l-80,80a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-80-80A8,8,0,0,1,53.66,90.34L128,164.69l74.34-74.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"></path>
                    </svg></div></button
                ><div class="iNXuQd4GjvimTZEgl" data-instant-type="accordion-content" style="--instant-accordion-content-height:auto;--instant-accordion-content-width:auto"
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text ipU9B9bgWF8Wzycw2"><p>Each Core is made from medical-grade polyester fiber infused with 100% organic natural essential oils from IFRA-certified EU farms. We use pharmaceutical-grade aromatics from certified manufacturers and natural plant extracts like peppermint, black pepper, cinnamon, and botanical aromas. Everything is blended in our Netherlands laboratory where we combine science and aromatherapy to create sophisticated, natural formulations.</p></div></div
                ></div
