                ><button class="iN3FdJq7c94AUroNk" data-instant-type="accordion-header" type="button"
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text ivPHPdXLJrIQcyxon"><h3>Does Lio contain nicotine?</h3></div
                  ><div data-instant-type="icon" class="i87h6Zdq9hKh6asSf">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="instant-icon">
                      <title>caret-down</title><path d="M213.66,101.66l-80,80a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-80-80A8,8,0,0,1,53.66,90.34L128,164.69l74.34-74.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"></path>
                    </svg></div></button
                ><div class="irqhDv6Sf5gTfPf4V" data-instant-type="accordion-content" style="--instant-accordion-content-height:auto;--instant-accordion-content-width:auto"
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text ilCKdkKjQnasD4ayV"><p>No. Lio is 100% nicotine-free. You&apos;re breathing pure air with natural aromatics while satisfying the behavioral patterns that make change so difficult.</p></div></div
                ></div
              ><div data-state="closed" class="iOph8Oit7Ur3cYPHY" data-instant-type="accordion-item"
                ><button class="iar55Z17kbuBlQvpf" data-instant-type="accordion-header" type="button"
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iPup1FEsumNqYL5qy"><h3>Is Lio vegan and allergen-free?</h3></div
                  ><div data-instant-type="icon" class="iQnYRcMxaLD4AHiey">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="instant-icon">
                      <title>caret-down</title><path d="M213.66,101.66l-80,80a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-80-80A8,8,0,0,1,53.66,90.34L128,164.69l74.34-74.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"></path>
                    </svg></div></button
                ><div class="i2UwRlMwPXvhyhdiY" data-instant-type="accordion-content" style="--instant-accordion-content-height:auto;--instant-accordion-content-width:auto"
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iIEwNKwYNCuDgHxM4"><p>Yes! Every aroma is 100% natural, vegan, and allergen-free. Safe to use anywhere, anytime, even after you&apos;ve brushed your teeth.</p></div></div
                ></div
              ><div data-state="closed" class="iN4PiCn2xbUUToCzz" data-instant-type="accordion-item"
                ><button class="i7oBLRk3i8UrwBIl9" data-instant-type="accordion-header" type="button"
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text izPDc24avtQ2gDtt7"><h3>Where do your ingredients come from?</h3></div
                  ><div data-instant-type="icon" class="iH24HdScjkIeglAR4">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="instant-icon">
                      <title>caret-down</title><path d="M213.66,101.66l-80,80a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-80-80A8,8,0,0,1,53.66,90.34L128,164.69l74.34-74.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"></path>
                    </svg></div></button
                ><div class="iHU6QJFMcPPw0uvGm" data-instant-type="accordion-content" style="--instant-accordion-content-height:auto;--instant-accordion-content-width:auto"
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iW6LFXMBN13lbEYMk"><p>All ingredients come from European IFRA-certified farms. Our pharmaceutical-grade aromatics are produced by certified manufacturers within the EU, extracted from natural ingredients only.</p></div></div
                ></div
              ></div
            ></div
          ><div class="i0sPvVvBLGjSoHpDm" data-instant-type="tabs-pane" id="0sPvVvBLGjSoHpDm"
            ><div class="iLNa75SDbWUr959Ep" data-instant-type="accordion-container" data-is-first-open="true" data-is-multi-open-enabled="false"
              ><div data-state="open" class="ihid96HQVPsq03wmf" data-instant-type="accordion-item"
                ><button class="is0V8uO2LiJkEJCZS" data-instant-type="accordion-header" type="button"
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text i9OJnDhbYhaVenRtm"><h3>How do the Flavour Cores work?</h3></div
                  ><div data-instant-type="icon" class="iQi9oV4HRpbk310zh">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="instant-icon">
                      <title>caret-down</title><path d="M213.66,101.66l-80,80a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-80-80A8,8,0,0,1,53.66,90.34L128,164.69l74.34-74.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"></path>
                    </svg></div></button
                ><div class="i7wB1w9kSqo2Znj4f" data-instant-type="accordion-content" style="--instant-accordion-content-height:auto;--instant-accordion-content-width:auto"
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text i9w89wKCWU8oALBVJ"><p>Each Core contains natural essential oils and plant extracts held in a medical-grade fiber matrix. As you inhale, air flows through the Core and picks up therapeutic scent that travels directly to your brain&apos;s olfactory region, helping to manage cravings, calm stress, and break unwanted habits.</p></div></div
                ></div
              ><div data-state="closed" class="i2utp1IM0NfulHK5Y" data-instant-type="accordion-item"
                ><button class="i7howkYxVFAfYi7ct" data-instant-type="accordion-header" type="button"
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iTwITZqL0mIUUeOGN"><h3>How long do Flavour Cores last?</h3></div
                  ><div data-instant-type="icon" class="irBd9nxfsTrP2iy11">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="instant-icon">
                      <title>caret-down</title><path d="M213.66,101.66l-80,80a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-80-80A8,8,0,0,1,53.66,90.34L128,164.69l74.34-74.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"></path>
                    </svg></div></button
                ><div class="iq0O9KiJ0gFAHRmg7" data-instant-type="accordion-content" style="--instant-accordion-content-height:auto;--instant-accordion-content-width:auto"
